("L-feature","@related/0/detail/zh","在不变的律下，可学的特征恰是经映射之归并同去者；推广所经的归并就是映射所给的那一个。"),
("L-feature","@related/0/detail/en","Under a still law, the learnable features are exactly those going alike across the map's lumping; the lumping generalization goes through is the one the map gives."),
("L-feature","@related/1/detail/zh","只经阈耦合入的条件只传递是否满足所需；读于外推，阈下的差别只在它在经映射的未来中显现、或从特征中消失之处可学（读法）。"),
("L-feature","@related/1/detail/en","A condition coupled in by threshold only passes only whether it meets the need; read for extrapolations, a difference below threshold is learnable only where it shows in the future through the map or vanishes from the feature (a reading)."),
